[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0010","text":"抱歉啊，日程安排得这么紧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0020","text":"没事，不要紧\n忙一点反而更安心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0030","text":"哈哈，嘛，美琴确实是这样的人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0040","text":"嗯\n特别训练也好好地在进行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0050","text":"那就好……\n怎么样，有感觉到什么眉目吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0060","text":"…………\n总觉得好像有什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0070","text":"……说不太清楚"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0080","text":"是吗，嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0090","text":"对不起"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0100","text":"没关系\n这种事本来就不是那么容易找到答案的吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0110","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0120","text":"……………………\n────是『传达的训练』对吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0130","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0140","text":"传达……\n用语言表达…………传达…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0150","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0160","text":"……慢慢去找就好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0170","text":"…………谢谢你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03250000_03_0180","text":"……………………"}]
